// Agent ONE AGENT SOMEBODY BUILT: what it is called, how it is addressed, what it is told, whose it is,
// who answers for it, the state it is in, how its last run went, the model it thinks with and the
// shared memory stores it names, and what may start it. The rest of what it may read and do, and its
