	// same way: the name lowercased, each run of anything but a letter or a digit one hyphen,
	// none at either end, cut at 40. A name that leaves nothing gives `agent`. One already taken
	// gets the lowest free `-2`, `-3` and on. Sent and already taken, it is refused: 409
