	// StopAllAiWithBody Stop all of the company's AI at once
	//
	// "'Stop all AI' on the All agents board pauses every company agent and every job running under
	// one, and stops machines taking new work, in one click." Every running job halts where it is,
	// as a Pause does, and keeps its session. "Nothing is deleted, and chats stay readable."
	//
	// THE REASON IS ASKED FOR: "The stop is in the audit log with its reason." Stopping again while
