	// personal one that is your own: "Where your environment supplies the key, the list is what
	// that environment allows; where you supply your own, it is what your key can reach." A
	// colleague's personal key is theirs alone. A profile that does not exist here, was removed or
	// is a colleague's is refused the same way: 422, naming `provider_profile_id`.
	//
	// THE MODEL IS NAMED AS ITS PROVIDER NAMES IT — "just a model ID under your own key". Which
	// models a key can reach is not asked yet, so a name the provider does not know is accepted
	// here and refused by the provider when it is first asked.
	//
	// CHANGING IT NEVER TOUCHES AGENTS THAT ALREADY EXIST, "because a running agent whose model
	// changed underneath it is a different agent with the same name".
	//
	// SENDING THE CHOICE YOU ALREADY HAVE changes nothing, and is answered as any other write is.
	//
	// ONLY A PERSON HAS A DEFAULT: a caller that is not a person is refused with 403
