	// IN USE, IT IS REFUSED: "while a running job or a live flow uses it, Storage's rule refuses
	// and names what" (409 `memory_store_in_use`). Nothing uses a store yet — a job reaches one
	// through the stores its agent names, and no job runs yet (ONPLO-3461), and no flow names one —
	// so this refusal is declared and not yet raised.
