	// ShareMemoryStoreWithBody Share a memory store
	//
	// "THE FAMILIAR SHARE CONTROL (teams/members + role: Viewer · Editor · Manager, the same words
	// the write rule uses). A store is a CONTAINER, so the role reaches the facts and knowledge files
	// inside it. Default deny."
