	// WITH A PERSON OR A TEAM, by id. Nobody by that id in this account environment is refused
	// (409 `recipient_not_found`).
	//
	// ONE OF THREE ROLES. Commenter is not offered on a store: the catalogue's share act lists
	// three.
	//
	// SHARING AGAIN CHANGES THE SHARE THAT IS THERE: "ONE DIRECT GRANT PER PERSON PER OBJECT"
	// (decision 0650), as for a chat. `created` says which it was, and the status is `200` either
	// way.
	//
	// `access_until` IS THE MOMENT THIS SHARE ENDS, as on every grant (decision 0650). One that has
	// already passed is refused (422 naming `access_until`, `access_until_passed`).
	//
	// THE IDENTITY SERVICE KEEPS THE GRANT, AND WRITES IT ITSELF. When it cannot be reached, 503
	// `identity_unavailable`: send the same request again.
	//
	// Takes any type of body and a specified content type.
	//
	// Corresponds with POST /memory-stores/{memory_store_id}/grants (the `ShareMemoryStore` operationId).
