	//
	// Access given across the whole account environment is changed where it was given (409
	// `share_placed_elsewhere`). A share that has ended is never brought back by changing its end
	// (409 `share_ended`): the person or team is shared with again. A new end that has already
	// passed is refused (422 naming `access_until`, `access_until_passed`).
