// PauseAgent Pause an agent
//
// ONE ACT, AND IT IS LOGGED. A live agent becomes paused and takes no new work. It deletes
// nothing, and `POST /agents/{agent_id}/turn-on` brings it back.
//
// ALREADY PAUSED IS NOT AN ERROR. The agent is answered as it stands.
//
// WHAT IS REFUSED (409). A draft was never on, and an agent that has stopped for good cannot
// be paused back into reach.
