// ONE EXCEPTION: A MEMBER'S OWN AGENT WHOSE OWNER LEFT WHILE IT WAS HELD comes back `stopped`, not
// paused, because "it never runs here again" is the leaving rule (the owner's ruling on ONPLO-5636,
// ONPLO-5744). The leaving left it quarantined, so the hold stood until this release.
