// RestoreAgentVersion Restore an earlier version of an agent
//
// "IT COMES BACK AS THE NEWEST SAVE." The version's name, what it was told, the provider
// profile and model it thought with and the memory stores it named become the agent's again, as a change like any other: what
// the agent was just before it is kept as a version in its turn, so the history stays whole and
// nothing in it is rewritten or removed. Where it stands and whose it is do not move: a live
// agent stays live.
