// DeleteChatForEver Delete a chat in Trash for ever
//
// "DELETE FOR EVER … ERASES IT NOW AND ASKS ONCE, and it is never an AI agent's to press." The
// chat and its history leave for good before the keep-time is up, and cannot come back.
//
// A MOVE, NOT A `DELETE`: `DELETE /chats/{chat_id}` puts a chat in Trash, and this is the
// second, deliberate act on one already there. A chat not in Trash is refused (409
// `chat_not_in_trash`).
