	//
	// ITS NAME, ITS INSTRUCTIONS, WHAT IT THINKS WITH AND THE MEMORY STORES IT NAMES. Every field is
	// optional and an omitted field is untouched.
	//
	// THE STORES SENT REPLACE THE STORES IT NAMED, each one you may read, by the rule of building one:
