	// A NEW PROVIDER & MODEL IS PICKED BY THE SAME RULE AS WHEN IT IS BUILT: a company profile of
	// this account environment, or a personal one that is your own, and every other profile refused
	// the same way: 422, naming `provider_and_model/provider_profile_id`. A model swap is a change
	// like any other, kept as one. The tests that gate "model swaps" are the trust pack's, and until
	// they are built nothing waits.
