	//
	// WHOSE IT BECOMES FOLLOWS BUILDING ONE (`POST /agents`), and is said in the request:
	// `company` is refused in a personal environment, and `personal` asked by an agent or a machine
	// (422, naming `owner_scope`). A personal copy is the caller's own, whoever built the original.
	//
	// THE IDENTITY SERVICE IS TOLD BEFORE THE COPY IS THERE FOR ANYBODY, as when one is built. When
