	// `recurrence_rule` or `time_zone`.
	//
	// A MOMENT WAKES THE AGENT ONLY WHERE ITS TRIGGERS NAME `schedule`; whether to act on one — a
	// paused agent, a budget spent — is AI's when the moment comes, and is recorded, never silent
	// (decision 0455). An agent in Trash or stopped for good takes no schedule (404).
	//
	// SERVED SINCE THE SERVER IMAGE HANDS AI THE PLATFORM SCHEDULER'S CLIENT (ONPLO-5526). The
	// three said "NOT SERVED YET" and answered 501 until then.
	//
	// Takes a body of the `application/json` content type, and returns a wrapper object for the known response body format(s).
