	// A DEFAULT FEATURE IS ALWAYS SHOWN — "always on, the minimum needed for the app to work;
	// cannot be switched off". Hiding one is refused with 409 `always_on`.
	//
	// A PREMIUM FEATURE YOU DO NOT HOLD HAS NO SWITCH. Showing or hiding it is refused with 409
	// `not_held`.
