	//
	// PREMIUM, AND WHOEVER ASKED PAYS (decision 1050): "A job a person gave counts that person's
	// Premium seat when its worker claims it", and a machine user or an agent that took the work
	// on its own counts its own. Without it, 409 `needs_premium`, and the job's `given_by` says
	// whose seat that is.
	//
	// SERVED SINCE THE SERVER IMAGE HANDS AI ACCOUNT'S ANSWER ABOUT A NAMED PERSON (ONPLO-5473,
	// ONPLO-5526): AI asks it whose seat counts (ONPLO-5476). This said "NOT SERVED YET" and
	// answered 501 until then.
	//
	// THE ANSWER CARRIES THE OVERLAP WARNINGS: every other live claim that names one of the same
	// files, "before either writes". A person picks who goes first; nothing here refuses an overlap.
