	// ExportMemoryStoreWithBodyWithResponse Export a memory store into a folder of Storage
	//
	// "EXPORT LEAVES AS PLAIN FILES IN ONE FOLDER, whatever the kind. A Linked-notes store leaves as
	// a portable vault. A Facts store leaves one file per fact, and a Conversation store one file
	// per conversation, each with its dates and naming who said what."
