	// said "Storage asks it" until 2 November 2026, which was wrong: Storage's door for our own
	// services asks no permission of its caller. A folder sent that is not in the storage the
	// store's export goes to is refused (422 naming `folder_id`).
	//
	// When Storage cannot be reached, 503: send the same request again.
	//
	// **NOT BUILT YET — it answers 501 (ONPLO-4042).**
