	//
	// The name, and nothing else yet. Every field is optional and an omitted field is untouched.
	//
	// THE CONNECTION IS NOT A FIELD HERE. A profile is one key's row: pointing it at another
	// connection would be another profile under an old name, with the old one's spend line.
	// Remove it and add one. ONE EXCEPTION, and it is its own operation: a company profile whose
	// connection was removed for good in the Integrations app has no key left to be the row of,
	// so a new one is picked for it — `POST /provider-profiles/{provider_profile_id}/connection`,
	// allowed only while `connection_removed_at` is set (decision 0723).
