	// EVERYONE IN THE ENVIRONMENT SEES IT by default: "a member simply uses what the company
	// enabled". A tool taken out of the catalogue is not listed.
	//
	// WHAT IT HOLDS TODAY: the MCP servers somebody added. Built-in tools and actions on connected
	// systems are listed from the change that builds each one's source (ONPLO-3392).
