	// `giver_person_ids`.
	//
	// EACH TEAM IN `giver_team_ids` HOLDS THE SAME GRANT, HELD BY THE TEAM, and the list sent replaces
	// the list the same way. People and teams are two lists: sending one leaves the other as it was. A
	// team the identity service does not keep in this company — deleted, another company's, or never
