// DeleteAgentWithResponse Delete an agent — to Trash
//
// "A DELETED AGENT WAITS IN TRASH, AND ONE CLICK BRINGS IT BACK." A draft, a live agent or a
// paused one goes: the three states the agent's own state list deletes from. From then on it
// is found by no operation here but the Trash's — `GET /agents-in-trash`, bringing it back,
