// removing an agent never silently breaks a flow or assistant". What uses an agent is the
// using app's to say, and nothing registers a use yet. Whether a delete is refused while
// something still uses the agent, or only warned about, is not stated (ONPLO-1546, point 3);
// until it is, this removes the agent and refuses for no such reason.
