// (503 `deletion_service_unavailable`); the same request can be sent again.
//
// An agent not in Trash is refused (409 `agent_not_in_trash`). Asked about this agent, as
// bringing one back is: "Delete for ever" may be held across the account environment or on
// one agent (`grantable_at: both`, pull request 2174, ONPLO-1723 point 1). This said "Held
// across the environment, as bringing one back is" until the catalogue ruled.
//
// Returns a wrapper object for the known response body format(s).
//
// Corresponds with POST /agents/{agent_id}/delete-for-ever (the `DeleteAgentForEver` operationId).
