// is asked of the agent named in the path: whoever holds it across the environment brings
// back any agent, and whoever was given it on one agent brings back that one. A CORRECTION,
// MADE IN THE OPEN: this said "HELD ACROSS THE ENVIRONMENT … granted across the account
// environment and never on one agent", and carried no `x-object-id`, until the catalogue
// ruled; a caller who held the permission only on another agent could then bring this one
